# This repository publishes the released program only (PA-100 R1). Everything is ignored except
# the allowlist below, so a stray source file, build or note cannot be committed. Release assets
# go to GitHub Releases, never into the repository.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/LICENSE.md
!/CHANGELOG.md
!/SECURITY.md
!/.github/
/.github/*
!/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/
/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/*
!/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/bug_report.yml
!/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/feature_request.yml
!/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/config.yml
